{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":566512,\"title\":\"Crucible of the Vampire\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A young museum curator Isabelle (Katie Goldfinch) is sent to look at an ancient artefact, discovered in the  basement of a stately home in Shropshire. Welcomed into the sprawling manor house by a seemingly hospitable  family; Karl (Larry Rew), his wife Evelyn (Babette Barat) and their beautiful daughter Scarlet (Florence Cady),  but all is not what it seems, as a dark and terrifying secret hangs over them.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wU6zyDsoOsyLusnHI54QazHog5X.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fdROF3ZusuvmqOUOY1BO1gcWITp.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2019,\"runtime\":104,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Iain Ross-McNamee\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1419821,\"name\":\"Iain Ross-McNamee\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":26862,\"name\":\"Neil Morrissey\",\"character\":\"Robert\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r20rYUygt7Vgj2oGsHnV6bLrLpI.jpg\"},{\"id\":32810,\"name\":\"Brian Croucher\",\"character\":\"Ezekiel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/db7RhcxpxNp0gOZGKzlw0qXFkZH.jpg\"},{\"id\":2213151,\"name\":\"Charles O'Neill\",\"character\":\"Jeremiah\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1623661,\"name\":\"Aaron Jeffcoate\",\"character\":\"Tom\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/igRuhGLo2iRsKbAYuFT1uaxRygs.jpg\"},{\"id\":1390005,\"name\":\"Larry Rew\",\"character\":\"Karl\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/npGdeQhDXtnjhxMmBigN99L2COL.jpg\"},{\"id\":2213154,\"name\":\"Lisa Martin\",\"character\":\"Lydia\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":70884,\"name\":\"Angela Carter\",\"character\":\"Veronica\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iTPh92VS1bEgi2ILhTL5YrFVRK1.jpg\"},{\"id\":17036