\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order's most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":45649,\"title\":\"Rubber\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mWgCORI5IC5vOvB2cDVQe0YNtXZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqfaq9uczoHBBug74eORBH4Jcpe.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the California desert, the adventures of a telepathic killer-tire, mysteriously attracted by a very pretty girl, as witnessed by incredulous onlookers.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":421792,\"title\":\"Down a Dark Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r3zuws3fT9zC7s8LILqEY9smjN0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eoTjilPmObqBMcXaBDBYTIPdB7e.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kit, a troubled girl, is sent to the exclusive Blackwood boarding school, where she discovers that only four other female students have been admitted to learn the four pillars of knowledge under the ominous wing of the mysterious headmistress Madame Duret.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":741434,\"title\":\"Homunculus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnqmGW6N9fxEyPEylC2qT4bbUmd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1eTfD2dnT5FbVZwgdJJISjzh2Fm.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A homeless man meets a medical school student who pays him to volunteer for a surgical procedure known as trepanation, drilling a hole in his skull, which ends up giving him the ability to communicate with the dark side of people’s subconscious minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":220447,\"title\":\"Black Butler\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vidfsb8UxcWIl0amKk7adYdKWVh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lbuF0PYFGrKnMh3GqwFnxNs3cHD.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in the year 2020, following her supposed death, a young woman returns as the son of her noble family to precede the family's prestigious company, with a demon at her side to avenge her parent's murder.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44351,\"title\":\"Rabbits\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8LHeas839avkylUmw1Q4uutZeR4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wAsE7lf0ggmLgtGJUegAUA3E5Pf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A story of a group of humanoid rabbits and their depressive, daily life. The plot includes Suzie ironing, Jane sitting on a couch, Jack walking in and out of the apartment, and the occasional solo singing number by Suzie or Jane. At one point the rabbits also make contact with their “leader”.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315205,\"title\":\"Good Manners\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dFGfmI9tIWCpEZbGUhI40uznL1F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDmDpjKFHovVk5cQFKeV7njJYtB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Clara, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn child. The two women develop a strong bond, but soon Clara discovers a terrifying secret about the child.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4970,\"title\":\"Gothika\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/frSGNQcWx1ek8dCduFYCux1ho7n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLBHPVQkJZyaSEUAGAFWNJJwmeo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a car crash, criminal psychologist Dr. Miranda Grey regains consciousness only to find that she's a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. She's been accused of murdering her husband Dr. Douglas Grey — but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-worker, Dr. Pete Graham, of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4997,\"title\":\"Wonderland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mfG8S7D4rYeVqvTzjc3D36PAK3R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jvgbITybzUZN6upjadXa644cwMD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the afternoon of July 1, 1981, Los Angeles police responded to a distress call on Wonderland Avenue and discovered a grisly quadruple homicide. The police investigation that followed uncovered two versions of the events leading up to the brutal murders - both involving legendary porn actor John Holmes.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4858,\"title\":\"The Invasion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CYOrYPfsyfw\",\"name\":\"Crucible of the Vampire - 2022 Film Trailer 4K\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Rbz_rZ_0dFU\",\"name\":\"CRUCIBLE OF THE VAMPIRE Official Trailer (2019) Horror\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}